53" end="1:34.806">我该如</span><span begin="1:34.806" end="1:35.033">何去</span><span begin="1:35.033" end="1:37.153">描述她那怅然若失的状</span><span begin="1:37.153" end="1:37.481">态</span></p></div><div begin="1:37.508" end="1:51.154" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v3"><p begin="1:37.508" end="1:40.831" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:37.508" end="1:38.640">望着高楼林</span><span begin="1:38.640" end="1:38.841">立的</span><span begin="1:38.841" end="1:39.316">CB</span><span begin="1:39.316" end="1:39.506">D</span> <span begin="1:39.506" end="1:39.704">哪里</span><span begin="1:39.704" end="1:39.927">是</span><span begin="1:39.927" end="1:40.149">她的</span><span begin="1:40.149" end="1:40.565">栖息</span><span begin="1:40.565" end="1:40.831">地</span></p><p begin="1:40.963" end="1:44.270" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:40.963" end="1:41.189">合</span><span begin="1:41.189" end="1:41.415">租的</span><span begin="1:41.415" end="1:42.746">出租屋有几平</span><span begin="1:42.746" end="1:42.963">米</span> <span begin="1:42.963" end="1:43.162">她的</span><span begin="1:43.162" end="1:43.370">生</span><span begin="1:43.370" end="1:43.577">日有</span><span begin="1:43.577" end="1:44.014">谁铭</span><span begin="1:44.014" end="1:44.270">记</span></p><p begin="1:44.386" end="1:47.739" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:44.386" end="1:45.327">未来总是</span><span begin="1:45.327" end="1:45.535">遥不</span><span begin="1:45.535" end="1:45.743">可</span><span begin="1:45.743" end="1:46.140">期</span> <span begin="1:46.140" end="1:46.353">生</span><span begin="1:46.353" end="1:46.566">活的</span><span begin="1:46.566" end="1:46.794">压</span><span begin="1:46.794" end="1:47.021">力更</span><span begin="1:47.021" end="1:47.256">喘不</span><span begin="1:47.256" end="1:47.491">上</span><span begin="1:47.491" end="1:47.739">气</span></p><p begin="1:47.801" end="1:51.154" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="1:47.801" end="1:48.326">为何在</span><span begin="1:48.326" end="1:49.606">如花似玉的年</s